  clueId: sf_candles
  displayTitle: By The Stairhead
  bodyText: Light them as you go and it will not care - it is not the flame it wants,
    it is you standing in it. Strike, set it down, and step out of the ring. And
    do not light them all at once. You will want the far end of the hall lit far
    more than you want this end lit, and there are only ten in the box.
